    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sulemani yoombakha inzu yOMWAMI",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Sulemani yachaaka okhuumbakha inzu yOMWAMI eYerusalemu mushikulu shiaMoria, ewa OMWAMI yaloleshela Daudi samwana, habundu tsana aha Daudi yarechekha, halutse lwaOrinani omuYebusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne yachaaka okhuumbakha mumwesi kwakhabili, mumuyika kwakhane okwoburuchibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emise echia Sulemani yakhupa khulwa obuumbashi bweinzu yaNyasaye njiechino; mbu oburambi, nibuchelwa amakhono kakhale, bwali amakhono amakhumi kasasaba, nobuchiikha amakhono amakhumi kabili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eshirookoola eshiali imbeli weinzu, oburambi bwashio bwali amakhono amakhumi kabili, obuchiikha bweinzu yeene shinga olwa bwali; nobuchinguukhu eshikhumi namakhumi kabili; nashifuuma mukari itsahaabu inzeleleshe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nayo inzu yeene ikhongo, mukari yachifuunishila tsimbaho tsiemitaraakwe, etsia yafuumakhwo itsahaabu inzeleleshe, nakholakhwo emisaala chiamashindu neminyolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi yasiaha inzu amachina kolukoosi khulwa obung'oonefu; ne itsahaabu eyo yali itsahaabu yaPariwaimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi yafuumakhwo inzu yosi itsahaabu, mbu emikuulo, nemishingachi, namasiisi, netsinzichi; nasaara abakerubi khwisiisi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana nakhola inzu tsana eyashila obutakatifu; oburambi bwayo bwali amakhono amakhumi kabili, obuchiikha bweinzu yeene shinga olwa bwali, khandi obuchiikha bwayo bwali amakhono amakhumi kabili; nachifuuma itsahaabu inzeleleshe, eyahela tsitalanda ebikhumi bisasaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obusiro bwemisumari bwahela tsishekeli amakhumi karaano tsieitsahaabu. Rhandi yafuuma ebisika ebiahekulu itsahaabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne munzu tsana eyashila obutakatifu, yakholamwo abakerubi babili bebisaala; nibabafuumakhwo itsahaabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsimbaha tsiabakerubi tsiosi halala tsiachelwa oburambi amakhono amakhumi kabili; mbu olubaha lwamulala lwahela amakhono karaano; niluula khwisiisi lieinzu; nolubaha lundi lwahela lurio amakhono karaano, niluula khulubaha Iwomukerubi undi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana olubaha Iwomukerubi undi lwahela amakhono karaano, niluula khwisiisi lieinzu; nolubaha lundi lwosi lwahela amakhono karaano, niluungana noluoana Iwomukerubi owambeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsimbaha tsiabakerubi abo tsiabambukha amakhono amakhumi kabili; nibasinjila nebilenje nibahenga habwelu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi yakhola ingubo inzelesia yeibuluu, neisambarau, neiranzayi, neikitani indorotoro, nakholakhwo abakerubi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Emilimo chiaHurantu-abi muHekalu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi imbeli weinzu yakhola tsisiilo tsibili etsia oburambi bwatsio bwali amakhono amakhumi kataru nakaraano; ne ingofia eyali hekulu khubuli siilo yahela amakhono karaano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakhola eminyolo shinga echiomwikosi, nachira khumirwe chietsisiilo; nakhola nende amakomamanga eshikhumi nakara khuminyolo tsana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nasinjisia tsisiilo etsio imbeli weihekalu, ndala khumukhono musaatsa, neyindi khumukhono mukhasi; eyali khumukhono musaatsa yachikulikha eliira mbu Yakhini; ne eyali khumukhono mukhasi yachikulikha eliira mbu Boazi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
